flowchart TD
    Start([Start Parallel Simulation]) --> OuterLoopInit[Step s = 0]
    OuterLoopInit --> CheckStep{s < Total Steps?}
    CheckStep -- Yes --> ForkThreads["OpenMP Team Fork (#pragma omp parallel for schedule(static))"]
    CheckStep -- No --> Finish([End Simulation])

    ForkThreads --> Thread0["Thread 0: Particles 0 .. (N/T - 1)"]
    ForkThreads --> Thread1["Thread 1: Particles N/T .. (2N/T - 1)"]
    ForkThreads --> ThreadK["Thread k: Particles kN/T .. ((k+1)N/T - 1)"]

    subgraph ThreadExec ["Independent Thread Work (Zero Data Sharing)"]
        direction TB
        Update["Update pos: x += vx, y += vy"]
        Bounce["Wall reflection (fmod periodic folding)"]
        Update --> Bounce
    end

    Thread0 --> ThreadExec
    Thread1 --> ThreadExec
    ThreadK --> ThreadExec

    ThreadExec --> Barrier["Implicit OpenMP Barrier (Join)"]
    Barrier --> NextStep["s++"]
    NextStep --> CheckStep
